  "lineFromMetadata": {
    "rule": "a validator rebuilds the signed line from the DP request alone: etny-cu|v2|<baked chainId>:<baked pox>|<dproc lower-case>|<cugflops>|<cuv>|<cuval>|<cun>|<cus>|<cut0>|<cut1>|<cusig0>|<cusig1>|heap=<cuheap>;workers=<cuworkers>, then verifies cusig over its statement bytes; cun, cus, cuheap and cuworkers carry the four fields of the line that no other key or chain state holds; the line carries no block numbers: cusig0 is recovered over the time statement rebuilt with node = dproc, nonce = cun, t = cut0, block = cub0, and cusig1 over the one with nonce = closeNonce(cun, cus, \"<cugflops>|<cuv>|heap=<cuheap>;workers=<cuworkers>\"), t = cut1, block = cub1",
