  "rateBound": {
    "rule": "a timed record is refused when its GFLOPS is above W / (t1 - t0 - A) x (1 + T) / 10^9, in integers gflops x 100 x (t1 - t0 - A) x 10^9 > W x (100 + T%); a window at or below A bounds nothing. W = rounds x workers x opsPerRound: rounds is benchmark.json's fullRounds for a trustedzone record and probeRounds for result field 13; a bench line's W is its region run's fixed work (bench-record.json benchChecks). The GFLOPS is measured on the enclave's clock, which the host supplies; the attested window bounds the real run from above. The writers apply the same bound before they sign.",
